title System Context — Run background jobs

Person(member, "Member", "Receives reminders and daily summaries")
Person(oncall, "On-call engineer", "Is alerted about dead-lettered jobs and replays them")
System(jubilee, "Jubilee", "Toronto's Christian marketplace")
System_Ext(email, "E-mail provider", "Delivers reminder and summary e-mail. Vendor to supply")
System_Ext(obs, "Observability platform", "Receives job metrics and alerts on-call. Vendor to supply")

